      en: ["Maximum quay depth reaches 18 meters", "Established in 1986 as a major infrastructure project", "Largest constituent port of the Port of Tallinn", "Handles over 20 million tons of cargo annually", "Equipped with specialized grain silos and elevators", "Direct connection to the broad-gauge railway network"],
